  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Carbon footprint study in hospitals of Shanghai</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study investigates and describes the status of carbon footprint in respresentative medical insitutions and hospitals in the Shanghai region, and will follow-up with a forum for sharing the results. With measurable results from the study, a feasible plan can be proposed to reduce the carbon emissions in Shanghai hospitals.</narrative>
